{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34417","headline":"奉和袭美醉中偶作见寄次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美醉中偶作见寄次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海鹤飘飘韵莫侪，在公犹与俗情乖。\n初呈酒务求专判，合祷山祠请自差。\n永夜谭玄侵罔象，一生交态忘形骸。\n怜君醉墨风流甚，几度题诗小谢斋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}